{"id":"n89867-2-4","stage":1,"title":"올라가다 · 前往首尔","scene":"约定前往首尔","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89867-2-4-1","ko":"자네, 언제쯤 서울에 오나?","zh":"你什么时候会来首尔啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자네,","meaning":"你（年长者对较年轻者）","explanation":"자네：年长者对较年轻的熟人使用的称呼；并非对所有人通用的“你”。","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"大约什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；-쯤 表示大致时间，언제쯤 是“大约什么时候”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제쯤","audio":"/audio/fd28178a926508f14a43.mp3"}},{"text":"서울에","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"서울에","audio":"/audio/96e9693781c161f4a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서울에","audio":"/audio/96e9693781c161f4a81f.mp3"}},{"text":"오나?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오나","audio":"/audio/ef95ee8ee12ea340a6ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你（长者对晚辈）","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"年长者对较年轻的熟人使用的称呼；语气带亲近或居高的位置。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbf82f5c39ca3ac1c746.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89867-2-4-2","ko":"네, 다음 주에는 올라갈 예정입니다.","zh":"嗯，我计划下周过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"嗯、是的","explanation":"네：礼貌应答对方，这里先表示听到提问，再说明自己下周去首尔的计划。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下一个、下周的","explanation":"다음：下一个；다음 주 指“下周”。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주에는","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에는","audio":"/audio/ec8167af940072d5c862.mp3"}},{"text":"올라갈","meaning":"去首尔","explanation":"올라가다 在这里指从地方前往首尔；-ㄹ 修饰后面的 예정，表示预定。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"2","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라갈","audio":"/audio/990285c603bdf7352b7c.mp3"}},{"text":"예정입니다.","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예정입니다","audio":"/audio/3f22f4beca63883d29a6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"嗯、是的","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"礼貌应答或表示认同；这里用来回应来首尔时间的提问。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c66